---
import VacationVisualShell from "./VacationVisualShell.astro";
---

<VacationVisualShell
  id="label-asymmetry"
  kicker="Platform disclosure logic"
  title="Label the robot. Ignore the human."
  dek="Provenance can identify how a file was made. It cannot prove that the human sentence beneath a real file is honest."
  footer="File provenance can establish origin and edit history. Interpretation still needs sources, context, and a method that can be challenged."
>
  <div class="label-split">
    <article class="vtn-card label-specimen label-specimen--synthetic">
      <div class="label-scanner" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <span class="vtn-label">Synthetic specimen</span>
      <div class="label-picture">A fake image<br />of a fake event</div>
      <ul class="label-tags" aria-label="Synthetic media labels">
        <li>AI generated</li>
        <li>Content credentials</li>
        <li>Creator disclosure</li>
        <li>Automated detection</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="label-caption">This image did not come from a camera event.</p>
      <p class="label-status label-status--warning">Inspection required</p>
    </article>

    <article class="vtn-card label-specimen label-specimen--authentic">
      <span class="vtn-label">Authentic specimen</span>
      <div class="label-picture">A real video<br />of a real event</div>
      <ul class="label-tags" aria-label="Authentic media properties">
        <li>Camera original</li>
        <li>Date removed</li>
        <li>Source cropped</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="label-caption">Human caption: “This proves the victim planned the entire thing for followers.”</p>
      <p class="label-status label-status--pass">File authentic. Move along.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <p class="label-rule">The pixels can be real. The relationship between the pixels and the sentence can still be bullshit.</p>
</VacationVisualShell>

<style>
  .label-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .label-specimen {
    min-height: 31rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .label-picture {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: 16.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    border: 4px solid var(--vtn-ink);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.15rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    padding: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .label-specimen--synthetic .label-picture {
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #f0d35d, #7e36a0 50%, #20233a);
  }

  .label-specimen--authentic .label-picture {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #7a9fac, #20252b);
  }

  .label-scanner {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    left: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    height: 0.85rem;
    animation: label-scan 3s linear infinite;
    background: var(--vtn-red);
    box-shadow: 0 0 1.25rem var(--vtn-red);
  }

  .label-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    list-style: none !important;
  }

  .label-tags li {
    margin: 0 !important;
    border: 2px solid var(--vtn-ink);
    background: var(--vtn-yellow);
    color: var(--vtn-ink) !important;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    padding: 0.38rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .label-caption {
    border: 3px solid var(--vtn-ink);
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--vtn-ink) !important;
    font: 700 1rem/1.35 Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }

  .label-status {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0 !important;
    border: 3px solid var(--vtn-ink);
    color: var(--vtn-ink) !important;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    padding: 0.55rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .label-status--warning { background: var(--vtn-red); color: #fff !important; }
  .label-status--pass { background: var(--vtn-green); }

  .label-rule {
    margin: 1.35rem 0 0 !important;
    background: var(--vtn-ink);
    color: var(--vtn-paper) !important;
    font: 900 clamp(1.45rem, 4vw, 2.65rem) / 1.05 Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  @keyframes label-scan {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(1.25rem); }
    50% { transform: translateY(15rem); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .label-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .label-specimen { min-height: 0; }
  }
</style>
